{"id":"evt_w2wqgjd7","issue_id":"eavs-5gf3","action":"closed","timestamp":"2026-07-31T10:40:44.144541860Z","harness":"pi","harness_session_id":"019fb7b5-a2cc-73a6-9a15-1af85bd6955c","session_name":"eavs: Implement TRX Owner Labels [posh-high-hits]","model":"Z-AI/glm-5.2","note":"Implemented (commit 70a327a). Full owner-label scope satisfied:\n\nSCOPE VERIFICATION\n- owner: Option<String> present on VirtualKey, CreateKeyRequest, KeyInfo, CreateKeyResponse (keys/types.rs) [pre-existing, verified]\n- owner TEXT column on virtual_keys + usage_history via idempotent ALTER TABLE migration mirroring oauth_user (keys/store.rs) [pre-existing, verified]\n- owner denormalized onto every usage_history row in update_usage() so rollups need no join and survive key deletion [pre-existing, verified]\n- update_owner() setter mirrors update_oauth_user (keys/store.rs) [pre-existing, verified]\n- GET /admin/usage/by-owner with ?owner= filter sums requests/input/output/cached/cache_write/cost_usd grouped by owner (api.rs, wired in main.rs) [pre-existing, verified]\n- OPTIONAL model/provider breakdown ADDED in this commit: store get_usage_by_owner_breakdown(by_model, by_provider); API ?breakdown=model|provider|model,provider; CLI 'eavs cost by-owner --breakdown ...'. OwnerUsage gains optional model/provider fields omitted from JSON unless requested.\n- 'eavs key create --owner' CLI flag added so keys can actually be tagged at creation (plus --oauth-user, which README advertised but was unimplemented).\n\nTESTS (proof of positive outcome)\n- cargo test: 384 passed, 0 failed.\n- keys::store::tests::test_owner_usage_rollup + test_owner_usage_breakdown: assert rollup across multiple keys, --owner filter, and model/provider sub-aggregation (3 mixed requests under 'alice' -> plain 1 bucket $0.35 / model-breakdown 2 buckets gpt-4 $0.30 + claude-3 $0.05).\n- keys::store::tests::test_migration_handles_legacy_usage_history (eavs-64qn regression): migration adds owner + cache_write_tokens columns to a legacy usage_history table.\n- api::tests::test_parse_owner_breakdown_{none,single,both,ignores_unknown}: query parsing.\n- E2E smoke (real keys.db via sqlite3 + eavs CLI): cost by-owner rolls up alice(3,$0.35)/bob(1,$0.01); --breakdown model,provider yields alice/gpt-4/openai, alice/claude-3/anthropic, bob/gpt-4/openai; JSON omits non-requested dimensions.\n- cargo clippy --tests: no warnings in edited files (store.rs/api.rs/cli.rs/main.rs)."}
